Package: JumbleCNV
Type: Package
Title: Copy Number Analysis of Short Read Sequencing Data
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Markus", "Mayrhofer", email = "markus.mayrhofer@ki.se", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Johan", "Lindberg", role = "aut"),
    person("Sarath", "Murugan", role = "aut")
  )
Description: JumbleCNV provides copy number analysis workflows for short-read
    sequencing data from targeted gene panels and whole-genome sequencing. It
    supports read-count generation, reference-panel construction, normalization,
    segmentation, quality-control summaries, and genomic instability scoring.
    The package is designed for reproducible analysis of sequencing-derived copy
    number profiles using Bioconductor genomic infrastructure.
URL: https://github.com/ClinSeq/JumbleCNV,
    https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.1101/2024.05.04.24306860v1
BugReports: https://github.com/ClinSeq/JumbleCNV/issues
